                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I`m only recommending  because it cost me the less than a coffee! And I did get 10 hrs decent play out of it. Overall this game has some good ideas but the execution is sadly lacking. For example, the campaign objections and order. You cant borrow money to help start up until you hit some lofty targets- by which stage you have either crashed or are flush with money. The attacks on your arcade are random and sometimes quite brutal in early stages.  The alien attack that steals your top of the range new pinball machine. Or the entirely unjustified customer rage fest where he kicks the crap out of multiple machines before you can afford security. The 80% happyness level objective  was the final straw for me. Arcade full. Top food and machine ratings. Everything upgraded and plenty of cleaners and entertainers. Everyone looked happy. But percentage just wouldn`t climb.  Frustrating.",
